{"voice":"","lines":[{"id":"L01","scene":"s01_darkness","text":"For billions of years,","file":"audio/vo/L01.wav","duration_s":2.15},{"id":"L02","scene":"s01_darkness","text":"RNA has carried information,","file":"audio/vo/L02.wav","duration_s":2.81},{"id":"L03","scene":"s01_darkness","text":"folded into structure,","file":"audio/vo/L03.wav","duration_s":1.69},{"id":"L04","scene":"s01_darkness","text":"regulated life,","file":"audio/vo/L04.wav","duration_s":1.57},{"id":"L05","scene":"s01_darkness","text":"and evolved into extraordinary biological diversity.","file":"audio/vo/L05.wav","duration_s":4.53},{"id":"L06","scene":"s01_darkness","text":"But to us,","file":"audio/vo/L06.wav","duration_s":0.97},{"id":"L07","scene":"s01_darkness","text":"much of its language remains hidden.","file":"audio/vo/L07.wav","duration_s":2.31},{"id":"L08","scene":"s02_universe","text":"We asked a simple question.","file":"audio/vo/L08.wav","duration_s":2.75},{"id":"L09","scene":"s02_universe","text":"What would happen if a model could learn that language directly from RNA?","file":"audio/vo/L09.wav","duration_s":5.29},{"id":"L10","scene":"s02_universe","text":"So we trained a foundation model across the RNA world.","file":"audio/vo/L10.wav","duration_s":4.64},{"id":"L11","scene":"s02_universe","text":"And something remarkable emerged.","file":"audio/vo/L11.wav","duration_s":3.29},{"id":"L12","scene":"s02_universe","text":"The model began to organize RNA.","file":"audio/vo/L12.wav","duration_s":2.99},{"id":"L13","scene":"s02_universe","text":"Not simply by sequence—","file":"audio/vo/L13.wav","duration_s":1.75},{"id":"L14","scene":"s02_universe","text":"but through representations that capture structure, function, and biological relationships.","file":"audio/vo/L14.wav","duration_s":6.04},{"id":"L15","scene":"s02_universe","text":"Every point you see here is an RNA.","file":"audio/vo/L15.wav","duration_s":3.4},{"id":"L16","scene":"s02_universe","text":"Together, they form the world our model has learned.","file":"audio/vo/L16.wav","duration_s":4.14},{"id":"L17","scene":"s03_enter","text":"And we can enter it.","file":"audio/vo/L17.wav","duration_s":1.54},{"id":"L18","scene":"s03_enter","text":"Choose a single RNA.","file":"audio/vo/L18.wav","duration_s":2.14},{"id":"L19","scene":"s04_language","text":"At first, we see only nucleotides.","file":"audio/vo/L19.wav","duration_s":3.9},{"id":"L20","scene":"s04_language","text":"A.","file":"audio/vo/L20.wav","duration_s":0.47},{"id":"L21","scene":"s04_language","text":"U.","file":"audio/vo/L21.wav","duration_s":0.59},{"id":"L22","scene":"s04_language","text":"G.","file":"audio/vo/L22.wav","duration_s":0.54},{"id":"L23","scene":"s04_language","text":"C.","file":"audio/vo/L23.wav","duration_s":0.56},{"id":"L24","scene":"s04_language","text":"But the model sees something more.","file":"audio/vo/L24.wav","duration_s":3.15},{"id":"L25","scene":"s04_language","text":"Across sequence, it learns reusable concepts—","file":"audio/vo/L25.wav","duration_s":3.46},{"id":"L26","scene":"s04_language","text":"patterns associated with motifs,","file":"audio/vo/L26.wav","duration_s":2.88},{"id":"L27","scene":"s04_language","text":"structure,","file":"audio/vo/L27.wav","duration_s":0.81},{"id":"L28","scene":"s04_language","text":"families,","file":"audio/vo/L28.wav","duration_s":0.89},{"id":"L29","scene":"s04_language","text":"and biological function.","file":"audio/vo/L29.wav","duration_s":2.01},{"id":"L30","scene":"s05_microscope","text":"These concepts form an internal vocabulary of RNA.","file":"audio/vo/L30.wav","duration_s":4.92},{"id":"L31","scene":"s05_microscope","text":"And because we can expose that vocabulary,","file":"audio/vo/L31.wav","duration_s":2.71},{"id":"L32","scene":"s05_microscope","text":"we can begin to see what the model has learned.","file":"audio/vo/L32.wav","duration_s":3.25},{"id":"L33","scene":"s06_structure","text":"From the same representation,","file":"audio/vo/L33.wav","duration_s":2.11},{"id":"L34","scene":"s06_structure","text":"we can move from sequence—","file":"audio/vo/L34.wav","duration_s":1.63},{"id":"L35","scene":"s06_structure","text":"to secondary structure—","file":"audio/vo/L35.wav","duration_s":1.48},{"id":"L36","scene":"s06_structure","text":"to three-dimensional structure—","file":"audio/vo/L36.wav","duration_s":1.73},{"id":"L37","scene":"s06_structure","text":"to fitness—","file":"audio/vo/L37.wav","duration_s":1.27},{"id":"L38","scene":"s06_structure","text":"and function.","file":"audio/vo/L38.wav","duration_s":1.41},{"id":"L39","scene":"s07_mutation","text":"But understanding RNA also means understanding change.","file":"audio/vo/L39.wav","duration_s":4.55},{"id":"L40","scene":"s07_mutation","text":"Change a single nucleotide.","file":"audio/vo/L40.wav","duration_s":2.51},{"id":"L41","scene":"s07_mutation","text":"And watch what happens.","file":"audio/vo/L41.wav","duration_s":2.24},{"id":"L42","scene":"s07_mutation","text":"The model's internal representation shifts.","file":"audio/vo/L42.wav","duration_s":3.18},{"id":"L43","scene":"s07_mutation","text":"Biological concepts change.","file":"audio/vo/L43.wav","duration_s":2.53},{"id":"L44","scene":"s07_mutation","text":"Structure changes.","file":"audio/vo/L44.wav","duration_s":2.06},{"id":"L45","scene":"s07_mutation","text":"Fitness changes.","file":"audio/vo/L45.wav","duration_s":1.8},{"id":"L46","scene":"s07_mutation","text":"One mutation.","file":"audio/vo/L46.wav","duration_s":1.68},{"id":"L47","scene":"s07_mutation","text":"Multiple scales of biology.","file":"audio/vo/L47.wav","duration_s":2.42},{"id":"L48","scene":"s08_foundation","text":"This is more than a collection of prediction tasks.","file":"audio/vo/L48.wav","duration_s":3.72},{"id":"L49","scene":"s08_foundation","text":"It is a shared representation of the RNA world.","file":"audio/vo/L49.wav","duration_s":3.74},{"id":"L51b","scene":"s09_sota","text":"And we can look inside it,","file":"audio/vo/L51b.wav","duration_s":1.97},{"id":"L52","scene":"s09_sota","text":"and ask what the model has actually learned.","file":"audio/vo/L52.wav","duration_s":2.91},{"id":"L53","scene":"s10_ending","text":"RiboLoop.","file":"audio/vo/L53.wav","duration_s":0.98},{"id":"L54","scene":"s10_ending","text":"A foundation model for the RNA world.","file":"audio/vo/L54.wav","duration_s":3.14}]}